#: ../../upstream/docs/user/addons.rst:152
msgid "Custom event integration"
msgstr "自定义事件集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/addons.rst:154
msgid ""
"Read the Docs provides a custom event ``readthedocs-addons-data-ready`` that"
" allows you to access the Addons data and integrate it into your theme or "
"documentation. The event provides access to the version data, project "
"information, and other Addons configuration."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 提供了一个自定义事件 ``readthedocs-addons-data-ready``，允许你访问 Addon "
"数据并将其集成到你的主题或文档中。该事件提供版本数据、项目信息和其他 Addon 配置的访问权限。"

